      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## Auto-Backup n8n Workflows to GitHub\n\n每天 **09:00（Asia/Shanghai）** 将当前 n8n workflows 增量同步到私有 GitHub 仓库。\n\n### How it works\n1. Daily Trigger 启动同步\n2. 并行获取本地 workflows 与 GitHub 根目录文件清单\n3. Calculate Sync Actions 将本地 JSON 序列化为与 Git 一致的 blob SHA\n4. 远端不存在 → Create\n5. SHA 不同 → Update\n6. 远端存在但本地不存在 → Delete\n7. SHA 相同 → 不产生任何 GitHub 写操作或空 commit\n\n### Safety\n- 仅处理仓库根目录的 `.json` 文件\n- 文件名由 workflow 名称规范化生成\n- 若两个 workflow 映射到同一文件名，流程直接失败并交给 Error Notification，避免静默覆盖",
          "height": 520,
          "width": 620
        },
        "id": "f641f045-7bd9-45d8-bad6-1dce0d5c24df",
        "name": "Note Overview",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          -272,
          -160
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## Setup Details\n\n### Credentials Required\n- **n8n API**: Used by `Fetch Local Workflows` to read your workflows\n- **GitHub OAuth2**: Used by all GitHub nodes to read/write files\n\n### Configuration Steps\n- [ ] Open `Fetch Local Workflows` → Select n8n API credential\n- [ ] Open `Fetch GitHub Files` → Select GitHub OAuth2 credential\n- [ ] Open all 3 Push nodes → Select GitHub OAuth2 credential\n- [ ] In `Fetch GitHub Files` → Set owner to your GitHub username\n- [ ] In `Fetch GitHub Files` → Set repository to your repo name\n- [ ] Repeat for all 3 Push nodes: Update owner and repository fields\n\n### GitHub Token Scopes\n- Private repos: `repo` scope required\n- Public repos: `public_repo` scope sufficient",
          "height": 468,
          "width": 496,
          "color": 2
        },
        "id": "daf4e575-cd03-455f-8199-181fc0e85656",
        "name": "Note Setup",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          448,
          -160
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## Sync Logic\n\n`Calculate Sync Actions` 使用 GitHub Contents API 返回的 **blob SHA** 做内容级增量判断：\n\n- **Create**：本地存在、GitHub 不存在\n- **Update**：本地计算的 Git blob SHA 与 GitHub SHA 不同\n- **Skip**：SHA 完全相同，不提交\n- **Delete**：GitHub 有对应 `.json`，本地已不存在\n\n因此稳定状态下每天运行可以是 **0 次 GitHub 写操作**。",
          "height": 320,
          "width": 340,
          "color": 3
        },
        "id": "19293bab-682e-45c9-9ea3-bd702407eccb",
        "name": "Note Logic",
